Package: plasma-codex-usage
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.10), plasma-framework
Description: Plasma panel widget with the remaining OpenAI Codex limit
 Shows how much of the OpenAI Codex subscription limit is left, as reported
 by the Codex CLI (codex app-server), and when it resets. The Codex CLI is
 not packaged here: install it with npm and log in with "codex login".
